appium-kiro-skills
==================

This project packages selected source code from the Appium MCP server into
standalone Kiro skills and hooks.

Portions of this software are derived from:

    appium-mcp
    https://github.com/appium/appium-mcp
    Copyright (c) Appium contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The following modules are lifted (and adapted to plain Node ESM, decoupled from
the MCP/fastmcp layer) from appium-mcp:

  lib/locators/source-parsing.mjs      <- src/locators/source-parsing.ts
  lib/locators/element-filter.mjs      <- src/locators/element-filter.ts
  lib/locators/locator-generation.mjs  <- src/locators/locator-generation.ts
  lib/locators/generate-all-locators.mjs <- src/locators/generate-all-locators.ts
  lib/utils/collection.mjs             <- src/utils/collection.ts
  lib/appium/session.mjs               <- src/utils/url.ts + src/tools/session/{attach-session,create-session}.ts
  lib/appium/command.mjs               <- src/command.ts (remote WebDriver subset)

lib/devicemanager/{adb,ios}.mjs are inspired by appium-mcp's devicemanager but
re-implemented over the raw `adb` / `xcrun simctl` CLIs to avoid pulling in the
heavy appium-adb / node-simctl dependencies.

